ses are required:Decoration 1000,Banner 2000,Refreshments 2000 and Memento  2000 Total 7000Rs.','2026-08-04 07:39:57'),(5719,1308,'Outreach Events','Campaigns',31,303,500000.00,500000.00,1,500000.00,500000.00,NULL,'Bhumi Fellowship Basecamp 2026 (Food & Refreshments, Transport, Boarding & Loading, Hall Arrangements, Faculty & Staff Renumeration)','2026-08-05 09:25:22'),(5720,1309,'Public Relations','Corporate Gift',50,422,50000.00,50000.00,1,50000.00,50000.00,NULL,'Corporate gift for the guest','2026-08-05 11:34:45'),(5721,1310,'IT Infrastructure','Hardwares',3,22,764000.00,764000.00,1,764000.00,764000.00,NULL,'We requires Virtual Reality (VR) headsets to support ongoing academic activities, student project work, and research in immersive technologies. In this regard, I am submitting below the quotation details for suitable models for your consideration and approval.\nWith due respect, I would like to bring to your kind attention that we are currently working on projects in two key areas: \n1. Medical simulation-based VR systems \n2. Industry-oriented VR application development \nThe projects focus on developing VR-based systems, clinical simulations, training applications, and immersive 3D tools. Currently, development is limited to Unity Editor simulations due to the lack of VR hardware, preventing real-world testing, deployment, and performance evaluation. To effectively complete ongoing projects and support future development, we kindly request approval for the procurement of the required VR/MR headsets and a high-performance workstation, as detailed given below. \nProduct 1 – Meta Quest 3 (VR Headset)\nProduct 2 – Galaxy XR\nProduct 3 – MANUS METAGLOVES PRO HAPTIC','2026-08-06 03:37:42'),(5722,1311,'Academic Events','Webinar',26,276,3500.00,3500.00,1,3500.00,3500.00,NULL,'Webinar and Alumni Talk','2026-08-06 05:36:51'),(5724,1313,'College Events','Day Celebrations',28,598,356.00,356.00,1,356.00,356.00,NULL,'Refreshment for hall arrangement in KSR hall ESDM& Dat