00\",\"after\":\"I submit that I propose to attend the Thirty Ninth National Convention of Textile Engineers and the National Seminar on \\\"Clothing the Globe - SWOT Perspective on the Future of Indian Textile\\\", organized by The Institution of Engineers (India), Madurai Local Centre under the aegis of the Textile Engineering Division Board on 07.08.2026 (Friday) at 9.30 a.m. at Er. K. Pakshirajan Hall.\\nThe programme will be highly beneficial in enhancing my knowledge of the textile industry, providing insights into emerging trends, challenges, opportunities, and the future scope of the Indian textile sector. The knowledge gained from this programme will be useful for academic and departmental activities.\\nThe estimated expenses for attending the programme are as follows:\\nParticulars\\tAmount (₹)\\nTravel Expenses\\t1,500\\nAccommodation\\t500\\nFood Expenses\\t500\\nTotal\\t2,500\\nHence, I kindly request your permission to attend the above programme and sanction an advance amount of ₹2,500 towards the travel, accommodation, and food expenses.\"}],\"budgetRowsChanged\":false,\"incomeRowsChanged\":false,\"budgetRowsCount\":3,\"incomeRowsCount\":0,\"actorRole\":\"user\",\"actorEmail\":\"nandagopal@ksrct.ac.in\",\"actorIsAdmin\":false}','2026-08-07 03:49:57'),(409,393,71,'sae@ksrct.ac.in','coordinator',0,'Budget breakup reviewed (2 row(s)) | Income rows reviewed (0 row(s))','{\"changedFields\":[],\"budgetRowsChanged\":false,\"incomeRowsChanged\":false,\"budgetRowsCount\":2,\"incomeRowsCount\":0,\"actorRole\":\"coordinator\",\"actorEmail\":\"sae@ksrct.ac.in\",\"actorIsAdmin\":false}','2026-08-07 07:02:11'),(410,283,188,'nandagopal@ksrct.ac.in','user',0,'2 field(s) updated | Budget breakup updated (3 row(s)) | Income rows reviewed (0 row(s))','{\"changedFields\":[{\"key\":\"description\",\"label\":\"Description\",\"before\":\"We kindly request your permission for the following five students from the Department of Textile Technology to participate in the NTTM – Product Development & Design Hackathon to be held at Bharat Mandapam, New Delhi, from 14.07.2026 to 17.07.2026.\\nStudents:\\n1.\\tNisha M.\\n2.\\tAbirama Selvi R. J.\\n3.\\tDinesh Kumar\\n4.\\tChidananda K.\\n5.\\tBharath S.\\nWe also request you to kindly sanction the required advance amount to meet the expenses for the above visit, as detailed below:\\nParticulars\\tAmount (₹)\\nTravelling Allowance\\t24,000\\nFood Expenses\\t10,000\\nAccommodation Charges\\t24,000\\nTotal\\t58,000\\nWe therefore request you to kindly accord permission for the above students to participate in the hackathon and sanction an advance amount of ₹58,000 (Rupees Fifty-Eight Thousand Only) towards travelling, food, and accommodation expenses.\",\"after\":\"Request for Approval of Expenses Incurred for NTTM – Product Development & Design Hackathon\\nI submit that the following five students from the Department of Textile Technology participated in the NTTM – Product Development & Design Hackathon held at Bharat Mandapam, New Delhi, from 14.07.2026 to 17.07.2026.\\nThe participating students were:\\n1.\\tNisha M.\\n2.\\tAbirama Selvi R. J.\\n3.\\tDinesh Kumar\\n4.\\tChidananda K.\\n5.\\tBharath S.\\nThe students attended the Hackathon as part of the academic and skill-development activities of the Department of Textile Technology.\\nThe actual expenses incurred for the above visit are detailed below:\\nParticulars\\tAmount (₹)\\nTravelling Allowance\\t16,333\\nFood Expenses\\t3,434\\nAccommodation Charges\\t19,800\\nTotal\\t39,567\\nHence, I kindly request you to accord approval for the above expenses amounting to ₹39,567/- (Rupees Thirty-Nine Thousand Five Hundred and Sixty-Seven only) incurred towards travelling, food, and accommodation expenses for the students who participated in the NTTM – Product Development & Design Hackathon.\"},{\"key\":\"total_budget\",\"label\":\"Total budget\",\"before\":\"58000.00\",\"after\":\"39567.00\"}],\"budgetRowsChanged\":true,\"incomeRowsChanged\":false