 given below. \\nProduct 1 – Meta Quest 3 (VR Headset)\\nProduct 2 – Galaxy XR\\nProduct 3 – MANUS METAGLOVES PRO HAPTIC\",\"after\":\"We require Virtual Reality (VR) headsets to support ongoing academic activities, student project work, and research in immersive technologies. In this regard, I am submitting below the quotation details for suitable models for your consideration and approval.\\nWith due respect, I would like to bring to your kind attention that we are currently working on projects in two key areas: \\n1. Medical simulation-based VR systems \\n2. Industry-oriented VR application development \\nThe projects focus on developing VR-based systems, clinical simulations, training applications, and immersive 3D tools. Currently, development is limited to Unity Editor simulations due to the lack of VR hardware, preventing real-world testing, deployment, and performance evaluation. To effectively complete ongoing projects and support future development, we kindly request approval for the procurement of the required VR/MR headsets and a high-performance workstation, as detailed given below. \\nProduct 1 – Meta Quest 3 (VR Headset)\\nProduct 2 – Galaxy XR\\nProduct 3 – MANUS METAGLOVES PRO HAPTIC\"}],\"budgetRowsChanged\":false,\"incomeRowsChanged\":false,\"budgetRowsCount\":1,\"incomeRowsCount\":0,\"actorRole\":\"finance_admin\",\"actorEmail\":\"headfinance@ksrct.ac.in\",\"actorIsAdmin\":false}','2026-08-10 06:55:42'),(415,349,335,'kiruthikag@ksrct.ac.in','user',0,'5 field(s) updated | Budget breakup updated (6 row(s)) | Income rows reviewed (0 row(s))','{\"changedFields\":[{\"key\":\"annexure_file_name\",\"label\":\"Annexure file name\",\"before\":\"Induction Honororium Proposal.pdf\",\"after\":\"Final Proposal MBA.pdf\"},{\"key\":\"annexure_storage_name\",\"label\":\"Annexure storage name\",\"before\":\"finance-annexure-1786000191959-65471592.pdf\",\"after\":\"finance-annexure-1786361376278-159532950.pdf\"},{\"key\":\"annexure_file_path\",\"label\":\"Annexure