s, fashion, sustainability, and technical textiles. The students also had the opportunity to interact with industry professionals, experts, and other participants from across the country. Their efforts received significant recognition, with the team securing the People’s Choice Award along with a cash prize of ₹21,000/- and the team also received a Special Category Performance Award.\"},{\"key\":\"annexure_file_name\",\"label\":\"Annexure file name\",\"before\":\"final.pdf\",\"after\":\"F.pdf\"},{\"key\":\"annexure_storage_name\",\"label\":\"Annexure storage name\",\"before\":\"finance-annexure-1783418903453-822456610.pdf\",\"after\":\"finance-annexure-1787074251048-955717964.pdf\"},{\"key\":\"annexure_file_path\",\"label\":\"Annexure file path\",\"before\":\"/uploads/finance-annexures/finance-annexure-1783418903453-822456610.pdf\",\"after\":\"/uploads/finance-annexures/finance-annexure-1787074251048-955717964.pdf\"},{\"key\":\"annexure_file_size\",\"label\":\"Annexure file size\",\"before\":\"198616\",\"after\":\"1320578\"}],\"budgetRowsChanged\":false,\"incomeRowsChanged\":false,\"budgetRowsCount\":3,\"incomeRowsCount\":0,\"actorRole\":\"user\",\"actorEmail\":\"nandagopal@ksrct.ac.in\",\"actorIsAdmin\":false}','2026-08-18 17:30:51'),(439,429,333,'headfinance@ksrct.ac.in','finance_admin',0,'1 field(s) updated | Budget breakup reviewed (14 row(s)) | Income rows reviewed (0 row(s))','{\"changedFields\":[{\"key\":\"description\",\"label\":\"Description\",\"before\":\"ESDM & Data Center Conclave Expenses\",\"after\":\"ESDM & Data Center Conclave on 1.8.26\"}],\"budgetRowsChanged\":false,\"incomeRowsChanged\":false,\"budgetRowsCount\":14,\"incomeRowsCount\":0,\"actorRole\":\"finance_admin\",\"actorEmail\":\"headfinance@ksrct.ac.in\",\"actorIsAdmin\":false}','2026-08-19 04:22:20'),(440,410,333,'headfinance@ksrct.ac.in','finance_admin',0,'1 field(s) updated | Budget breakup reviewed (3 row(s)) | Income rows reviewed (1 row(s))','{\"changedFields\":[{\"key\":\"description\