the team also received a Special Category Performance Award. ','Department','Textile Technology','Events',43,NULL,'Student Empowerment',41,NULL,NULL,'No',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Others','F.pdf','finance-annexure-1787074251048-955717964.pdf','/uploads/finance-annexures/finance-annexure-1787074251048-955717964.pdf','application/pdf',1320578,39567.00,0.00,'pending',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,'pending',NULL,188,'pending','{\"flow\": [\"level1\", \"dof\", \"principal\", \"chairman\"], \"status\": \"in_progress\", \"version\": 1, \"startedAt\": \"2026-08-18T17:30:51.873Z\", \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-19T06:23:06.253Z\", \"resolvedAt\": null, \"financeMeta\": {\"unplannedBudgetAmount\": null, \"unplannedBudgetEnabled\": false}, \"currentStage\": \"principal\", \"lastDecision\": \"approved\", \"lastFeedback\": null, \"resubmittedAt\": \"2026-08-18T17:30:52.147Z\", \"submittedTotalBudget\": 39567, \"isEditableByApplicant\": false}','2026-07-07 10:08:23','2026-08-19 06:23:06'),(284,164,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-07','National MSME Day Celebration on 04.07.2026. For this six expert speakers from the MSME sector, banking institutions, entrepreneurship development organizations, industry, and government agencies has came and speak about the schemes. The participants are from KSRCT as well as external institutions, entrepreneurs, startups, and the general public. ','Centre','KSRCT MSME Business Incubator','Events',11,29,'College Events',28,'Day Celebrations',598,'No',NULL,0.00,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Others','MSME Day Celebration 2026.pdf','finance-annexure-1783419600235-789174276.pdf','/uploads/finance-annexures/finance-annexure-1783419600235-789174276.pdf','application/pdf',160449,38500.00,38500.00,'pending',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,'pending',NULL,83,'approved','{\"flow\": [\"level1\", \"dof\", \"principal\", \"chairman\"], \"status\": \"completed\", \"version\": 1, \"startedAt\": \"2026-