ity Research to be held on 15.07.2026 at 08:30 a.m. at ISRO Headquarters, Antariksh Bhavan, Bengaluru.\nThe workshop will provide valuable insights into current developments in microgravity research and its applications, which will be beneficial for academic and research activities in our institution.\nHence, I kindly request you to grant me permission to attend the above workshop. I also request you to kindly sanction an advance amount of Rs. 2,000/- to meet the expenses for the official visit, as detailed below:\nParticulars	Amount (Rs.)\nTravel Allowance	1,500\nFood Expenses	500\nTotal	2,000\n','Faculty','Dr Nandagopal K R','Skilling',43,NULL,'Faculty Empowerment',39,NULL,NULL,'No',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Email','Gmail - WOC_ Confirmation of Participation â Microgravity Workshop.pdf','finance-annexure-1783617440390-667454187.pdf','/uploads/finance-annexures/finance-annexure-1783617440390-667454187.pdf','application/pdf',100368,2000.00,0.00,'pending',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,'pending',NULL,188,'deleted','{\"flow\": [\"level1\", \"dof\", \"principal\"], \"status\": \"deleted\", \"version\": 1, \"deletedAt\": \"2026-07-09T17:23:41.138Z\", \"startedAt\": \"2026-07-09T17:17:21.484Z\", \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-09T17:23:41.138Z\", \"resolvedAt\": \"2026-07-09T17:23:41.138Z\", \"financeMeta\": {\"unplannedBudgetAmount\": null, \"unplannedBudgetEnabled\": false}, \"currentStage\": \"deleted\", \"lastDecision\": \"deleted\", \"lastFeedback\": \"Deleted by user\", \"deletedByEmail\": \"nandagopal@ksrct.ac.in\", \"deletedByUserId\": 188, \"submittedTotalBudget\": 2000, \"isEditableByApplicant\": false}','2026-07-09 17:17:20','2026-07-09 17:23:41'),(296,197,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-09','Request for Permission to Participate in National Workshop on Microgravity Research and Sanction of Advance Amount\nI have been invited to participate in the National Workshop on Microgravity Research to be held on 15.07.2026 at 08:30