Division Board on 07.08.2026 (Friday) at 9.30 a.m. at Er. K. Pakshirajan Hall.\nThe programme will be highly beneficial in enhancing my knowledge of the textile industry, providing insights into emerging trends, challenges, opportunities, and the future scope of the Indian textile sector. The knowledge gained from this programme will be useful for academic and departmental activities.\nThe estimated expenses for attending the programme are as follows:\nParticulars	Amount (₹)\nTravel Expenses	1,500\nAccommodation	500\nFood Expenses	500\nTotal	2,500\nHence, I kindly request your permission to attend the above programme and sanction an advance amount of ₹2,500 towards the travel, accommodation, and food expenses.\n','Faculty','Dr Nandagopal K R','Skilling',43,NULL,'Faculty Empowerment',39,NULL,NULL,'No',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pamphlet','krn-madurai.pdf','finance-annexure-1786036763277-44919210.pdf','/uploads/finance-annexures/finance-annexure-1786036763277-44919210.pdf','application/pdf',128450,2500.00,0.00,'pending',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,'pending',NULL,188,'pending','{\"flow\": [\"level1\", \"dof\", \"principal\"], \"status\": \"in_progress\", \"version\": 1, \"startedAt\": \"2026-08-06T17:19:24.369Z\", \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-25T04:20:57.222Z\", \"resolvedAt\": null, \"financeMeta\": {\"unplannedBudgetAmount\": null, \"unplannedBudgetEnabled\": false}, \"currentStage\": \"principal\", \"lastDecision\": \"approved\", \"lastFeedback\": null, \"submittedTotalBudget\": 2500, \"isEditableByApplicant\": false}','2026-08-06 17:19:23','2026-08-25 04:20:57'),(393,168,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07','On behalf of the KSRCT SAEINDIA Collegiate Club, in association with the Department of Mechanical Engineering and the Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering, we propose to organize two guest lectures on 08.08.2026 for the benefit of our students.\nThe details of the guest lectures are as follows:\nGuest Lecture 1\nTopic: Commercial Vehicle Suspension Systems: Fundamentals and Recent Advancements\nResource Person: Mr. Lojanan A., Manager – Chassis & Suspension, Ashok Leyland, Chennai\nGuest Lecture 2\nTopic: Software Defined Vehicles (SDVs)\nResource Person: Mr. Gugainamasivayam S., Assistant General Manager, ZF CVCS India Limited, Chennai\nIn this regard, we kindly request your approval to conduct the above guest lectures. We also request you to sanction a sum of Rs. 2,500/- towards the expenses for mementos and gifts for the resource persons, and food and refreshments for the chief guests.','Professional Body','SAE Collegiate Club','Academics',12,51,'Academic Events',26,'Guest Lecture',270,'No',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Others','Guest Lecture details.pdf','finance-annexure-1786079422925-18046872.pdf','/uploads/finance-annexures/finance-annexure-1786079422925-18046872.pdf','application/pdf',101519,2500.00,0.00,'pending',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,'pending',NULL,72,'pending','{\"flow\": [\"level1\", \"dof\", \"principal\"], \"status\": \"in_progress\", \"version\": 1, \"startedAt\": \"2026-08-07T05:10:23.615Z\", \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-21T08:50:24.807Z\", \"resolvedAt\": null, \"financeMeta\": {\"unplannedBudgetAmount\": null, \"unplannedBudgetEnabled\": false}, \"currentStage\": \"principal\", \"lastDecision\": \"approved\", \"lastFeedback\": null, \"submittedTotalBudget\": 2500, \"isEditableByApplicant\": false}','2026-08-07 05:10:23','2026-08-21 08:50:24'),(394,199,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07',' Request for Approval of Servicing Charges for the Curing Machine and Padding Mangle\nI submit that the servicing of the Curing Machine and Padding Mangle in the Textile Chemical Processing Laboratory has been successfully completed to ensure the smooth conduct of practical classes in the Department of Textile Technology.\nThe servicing was carried out to restore the machines to proper working condition and facilitate uninterrupted laboratory sessions for the students.\nThe total servicing charges amount to ₹3,500.\nHence, I kindly request your kind approval for the completed servicing work and sanction of the service bill amounting to ₹3,500.\n','Department','Textile Technology','Laboratory',43,NULL,'Maintenance Charges',9,NULL,NULL,'No',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bills','Finalservice bill.pdf','finance-annexure-1786082115461-644557388.pdf','/uploads/finance-annexures/finance-annexure-1786082115461-644557388.pdf','application/pdf',570742,3500.00,0.00,'pending',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,'pending',NULL,85,'pending','{\"flow\": [\"level1\", \"dof\", \"principal\"], \"status\": \"in_progress\", \"version\": 1, \"startedAt\": \"2026-08-07T05:55:16.051Z\", \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-21T08:33:14.725Z\", \"resolvedAt\": null, \"financeMeta\": {\"unplannedBudgetAmount\": null, \"unplannedBudgetEnabled\": false}, \"currentStage\": \"principal\", \"lastDecision\": \"approved\", \"lastFeedback\": null, \"submittedTotalBudget\": 3500, \"isEditableByApplicant\": false}','2026-08-07 05:55:15','2026-08-21 08:33:14'),(395,58,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07','Attended the Revature AI Academy Summit on 04.08.2026 at Chennai. 04 nos are attended (Principal, Director Ranking and accreditation, Director Industry Institute Interaction and Training Officer). Travel and food expenses are attached.','Institution','K.S.Rangasamy College of Technology','Events',5,NULL,'Conferences & Conclaves',29,'Conclave',291,'No',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bills','Revature bill (1)_merged.pdf','finance-annexure-1786083129562-936273719.pdf','/uploads/finance-annexures/finance-annexure-1786083129562-936273719.pdf','application/pdf',755830,2322.00,0.00,'pending',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,'pending',NULL,225,'pending','{\"flow\": [\"dof\", \"principal\"], \"status\": \"in_progress\", \"version\": 1, \"startedAt\": \"2026-08-07T06:12:10.120Z\", \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-21T08:31:32.772Z\", \"resolvedAt\": null, \"financeMeta\": {\"unplannedBudgetAmount\": null, \"unplannedBudgetEnabled\": false}, \"currentStage\": \"principal\", \"lastDecision\": \"approved\", \"lastFeedback\": null, \"submittedTotalBudget\": 2322, \"isEditableByApplicant\": false}','2026-08-07 06:12:09','2026-08-21 08:31:32'),(396,14,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-07','We require Virtual Reality (VR) headsets to support ongoing academic activities, student project work, and research in immersive technologies. In this regard, I am submitting below the quotation details for suitable models for your consideration and approval.\nWith due respect, I would like to bring to your kind attention that we are currently working on projects in two key areas: \n1. Medical simulation-based VR systems \n2. Industry-oriented VR application development \nThe projects focus on developing VR-based systems, clinical simulations, training applications, and immersive 3D tools. Currently, development is limited to Unity Editor simulations due to the lack of VR hardware, preventing real-world testing, deployment, and performance evaluation. To effectively complete ongoing projects and support future development, we kindly request approval for the procurement of the required VR/MR headsets and a high-performance workstation, as detailed given below. \nProduct 1 – Meta Quest 3 (VR Headset)\nProduct 2 – Galaxy XR\nProduct 3 – MANUS METAGLOVES PRO HAPTIC','Department','CSE (Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning)','Research',2,NULL,'IT Infrastructure',3,NULL,NULL,'No',NULL,0.00,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Quotation','Quotation_VR.pdf','finance-annexure-1786085293147-44921127.pdf','/uploads/finance-annexures/finance-annexure-1786085293147-44921127.pdf','application/pdf',135235,764000.00,764000.00,'pending',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,'pending',NULL,39,'approved','{\"flow\": [\"level1\", \"dof\", \"principal\", \"chairman\